Scaffold
 └── Center
      └── Card
           └── Column
                ├── Image (Movie Poster)
                ├── Text (Movie Name)
                ├── Row
                │    ├── Icon (Location)
                │    └── Text (Cinema Name)
                ├── Text (Date & Time)
                └── ElevatedButton (Book Ticket)

Explanation:

=>Scaffold – Creates the main screen.

=>Center – Places the ticket card in the center.

=>Card – Gives the movie ticket a card-like appearance.

=>Column – Arranges all widgets vertically.

=>Image – Displays the movie poster.

=>Text – Shows the movie name.

=>Row – Displays the location icon and cinema name together.

=>Text – Shows the show date and time.

=>ElevatedButton – Displays a Book Ticket button.
